    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Evil",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "human"
      },
      "cr": 7,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet — Brigadier Malakor Vance.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>malakor-vance</code>): Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Evil; CR 7 (proficiency +3, to hit +6 with STR); AC 17 (Legion officer plate), hit points 112 (15d8+45), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Brigadier Malakor Vance oversees border pacification along the fracture lines. Like General Ironhand, Vance possesses the terrifying calm of an administrator managing an inventory ledger: lives are simply logistical assets, and insubordination is an error code that must be cleared from the system.</p><p>He views the war not as an emotional conflict, but as an engineering equation waiting for total compliance.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> tactical commander · <strong>tier:</strong> Cordon Commander · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Cordon Command.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/iron-legion/malakor-vance.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 510001, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A stern middle-aged human commander in heavy gunmetal-grey plate armor with a high gorget and tailored dark charcoal greatcoat. A mechanical star-bit monocular implant glows cyan over his left eye. Holding an ornate steel officer's saber in one hand and a wrist-mounted repeater gauntlet on the other. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
